        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/2bfe46/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-16T21:50:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What a nice silly activity!</p><p>I taught him Unity (and stupidly wrote Sentinels Comics, and now that's going to be on there forever, nooooo...). He's starting to figure her out. After three games, he still hasn't guessed her, but the third time he did have her on the list.&nbsp;</p><p>Also, Unity is now, for all intents and purposes, from comic books and video games and has a pet (because robot-friends wasn't an option).&nbsp;</p><p>Edited to add: He guessed Unity right on the fourth try. And I found out how to fix stupid typos, too!)</p>",
